SUMMARY:Breakfast with Santa & Friends at Kitchen Kettle Village
DESCRIPTION:The magic is back…make your holidays merry & bright with a visit to Kitchen Kettle Village. Enjoy a delicious buffet breakfast in the newly renovated Kling House Restaurant\, caroling with our Holiday Elf\, a fun scavenger hunt\, and of course\, be ready to share your holiday wish list with Santa and a few of his friends. \nSeatings are by reservation at 8:30am and 9:45am at The Kling House Restaurant. \nCreate cherished family memories bound to get you in the holiday spirit! This festive family event includes: \n\nDelicious buffet breakfast in The Kling House Restaurant from 8:30am – 9:15am OR 9:45am – 10:30am\nEnjoy a Caroling Experience with our Holiday Elf & Santa in the Village at 9:30am or 10:45am\, depending on your reservation. Guests will sing carols at 4 different Village shops.\nA stocking for each child 10 and under\, with a Scavenger Hunt of goodies to collect throughout the Village\nChildren can color and personalize a letter to Santa and drop it in the North Pole mailbox\nGingerbread man cookie decorating promptly following breakfast\nPhoto opportunities with Santa during breakfast and after caroling. Don’t forget your camera!\nFamilies will love the buffet featuring:\nScrambled Eggs\nHam\nSausage\nFrench Toast Sticks\nBreakfast Potatoes\nFresh Fruit\nYogurt\nBeverages: Hot Chocolate\, Coffee\, Juice\n\n2026 Event Dates & Times: \nReservations at 8:30am and 9:45am\nNEW Seating – Friday\, November 27th\nSaturday\, November 28th\nSaturday\, December 5th\nSaturday\, December 12th\nSaturday\, December 19th \nCost\nChildren: $17.99 (ages 1-10)\nAdults: $25.99\nInfants: Free (under age 1) \n*Sales tax and a small booking fee may be added. \nReservations are required for all guests attending this special event. They can be purchased online or by calling 1-800-732-3538 to reserve a table. Reservations are non-refundable. \n\nBook Now
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/breakfast-with-santa-friends-at-kitchen-kettle-village/2026-11-28/
LOCATION:Kitchen Kettle Village\, 3529 Old Philadelphia Pike\, (Route 340)\, Intercourse\, PA\, 17534\, United States
